## Multi-context note

This template assumes a single CONTEXT.md at the project root. If the project grows multiple bounded contexts, Pocock's format supports a CONTEXT-MAP.md at the root that lists each context's location and how they relate. See `.claude/skills/preflight/CONTEXT-FORMAT.md` (a core skill — always present) or the upstream spec at `https://github.com/mattpocock/skills/blob/main/skills/engineering/grill-with-docs/CONTEXT-FORMAT.md`.
